# Changelog (day-to-day)

`CHANGELOG.md` is the developer log (English, short). sanity has no user-facing release notes file.

After every completed task, add a bullet at the **end** of the **last `##` heading** in `CHANGELOG.md` (newest version is last in the file). Merge similar bullets when that reads better.

```
- TYPE: Short description
```

`TYPE`: `FEAT`, `FIX`, `DOCS`, `REFACTOR`, `PERF`, `TEST`, `CHORE`, `STYLE`, `REVERT`, `CI` (ALL CAPS).

Suggest **two** concise commit messages (lowercase Conventional Commits prefix: `feat:`, `fix:`, …).

Publishing is two steps in `.claude/rules/changelog-publish.mdc` (only when the user asks): finalize the current version (summary, then tag), then bump to the next version.
